{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>謝安琪近期與 Ivy So合唱充滿古典詩意新歌《葬花辭》引爆全網熱烈討論，大批資深網民隨即翻出她早於12年前拍攝一輯極度罕見「人妻旗袍床照」作回顧，這輯來自免費雜誌的絕版靚相，展現當年37歲謝安琪極致誘惑嘅模樣！ 一買要買兩本！封面與的封底合拼，才...</p>\n<p>謝安琪近期與 Ivy So合唱充滿古典詩意新歌《葬花辭》引爆全網熱烈討論，大批資深網民隨即翻出她早於12年前拍攝一輯極度罕見「人妻旗袍床照」作回顧，這輯來自免費雜誌的絕版靚相，展現當年37歲謝安琪極致誘惑嘅模樣！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956847084312953_21312662706b07f964e5bde.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"895794322_10166176825710555_202944755977262784_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956847084312953_21312662706b07f964e5bde.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>一買要買兩本！封面與的封底合拼，才能展現橫躺羅漢床的誘人甫士！（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>謝安琪絕密旗袍床照誘惑全網</h2>\n<p>當年已為人妻兼育有一子謝安琪為雜誌拍攝封面及內頁寫真，換上粉白底色配以大紅牡丹花紋貼身改良旗袍。相片中她穿上紅色高跟鞋斜臥在床榻及中式貴妃椅上，高衩剪裁完美展現修長美腿與玲瓏浮凸曲線。配以復古紅唇與迷離眼神，將東方女性嫵媚與獨有成熟韻味發揮至極致。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956847117689716_1217399266b07f96847dfe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20231005000041409-1005_00862_001_05p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956847117689716_1217399266b07f96847dfe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>仲有裸足半穿紅鞋Close UP （圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471330621593_10886968336b07f969a5429.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468911053_10160252867752680_8498390164223861619_n (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471330621593_10886968336b07f969a5429.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471422627385_16061685686b07f96aa26bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468871134_10160252867747680_3084167775371190416_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471422627385_16061685686b07f96aa26bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>絕版雜誌記載謝安琪性感身姿令人想入非非</h2>\n<p>這輯惹火相片源自2014年10月出版免費雜誌，除了橫躺羅漢床全版跨頁封面及封底，內頁更有對鏡化妝等多個造型。目前該期雜誌已經完全絕版，市面上極少流通，近年在網上拍賣平台更被炒賣至高達80元不等。這批珍貴影像不僅紀錄了當時狀態巔峰時刻，更成為眾多粉絲爭相收藏珍品。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471505357581_12455910876b07f96b9b7b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468934323_10160252867757680_7817847010226097797_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471505357581_12455910876b07f96b9b7b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471635977142_5719769506b07f96cbcf4a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"O0xipUw.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471635977142_5719769506b07f96cbcf4a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471726222890_9265249506b07f96dc4ec7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468861006_10160252867732680_1163494715371682667_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471726222890_9265249506b07f96dc4ec7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>兩年後懷第二胎 產後復出簽約麥浚龍成功瘦身</h2>\n<p>拍攝這輯寫真兩年後，謝安琪宣布懷上第二胎，至2017年產女初期因專注照顧家庭及餵哺母乳，身形與臉龐一度較為圓潤。女兒斷奶後她隨即簽約麥浚龍旗下準備復出，並開始嚴格執行自然瘦身計劃。透過每週三次舉重訓練、跑步、行山及瑜伽，她在約一年內成功減去30磅，體重回落至懷孕前100磅左右，更曾罕有晒出腹肌與馬甲線照片。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471818363031_12830114916b07f96f0321b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"903699054_10166176826255555_8515503030074503044_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471818363031_12830114916b07f96f0321b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%ac%9d%e5%ae%89%e7%90%aa-%e8%98%87%e9%9b%85%e7%90%b3-%e8%91%ac%e8%8a%b1%e8%be%ad-3550066/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">謝安琪 IvySo 破天荒合唱《葬花辭》 12年前絕密旗袍床照意外出土 兩代女神魅力對決：完全唔輸蝕</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%98%87%e9%9b%85%e7%90%b3-%e8%91%ac%e8%8a%b1%e8%be%ad-%e8%ac%9d%e5%ae%89%e7%90%aa-3550212/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ivy So現身商台「貼身戰衣」洗版 完美曲線中正流量密碼 網民熱議平價同款</a></p>\n<h2>網民激讚新歌《葬花辭》與舊照</h2>\n<p>隨著這組相隔12年「出土」舊照與與Ivy So合唱的新歌《葬花辭》古典風格互相輝映，各大討論區隨即引發熱烈討論。不少人留言大讚當年狀態勇猛：「當年呢輯旗袍床照真係風華絕代，完全係天花板級數！」更有大批忠實歌迷表示當年造型毫不輸蝕：「12年前謝安琪真係一啲都唔輸蝕，甚至多咗份女人味」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471505357581_12455910876b07f96b9b7b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"468934323_10160252867757680_7817847010226097797_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568471505357581_12455910876b07f96b9b7b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HMVISS）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T02:03:51.367345+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1338,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T01:30:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:57:38.508128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T01:57:27.348466+00:00","content_hash":"9a792b79adc5d5b1b0fd454222ec5ea04fde639282a64fce90c27d5984b77e30","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}